078833439_8728692605156897802_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OApuoDqdL-sQ7kNvwGlaLpC&_nc_oc=AdrhQwfVhApTwc-DdpNzt6hUzYBQTtfQj6cK-5VnWtK9ymR8XWKdXAZzl9xbcnAjQyk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQpROiqyQQOif_6VSKzPIaYPmYNsN9Gpnd3CfaBc0iAmQ&oe=6AEDF181"}, {"file_name": "SS 4.png", "id": "1790412402137681", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/604317775_1790412405471014_2985767044040386723_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=v38tfPPW2NcQ7kNvwHsTRDq&_nc_oc=AdrLZFemxhXmWP1KExfzg9qmGBBAAT6PyhmwBjOqDY2cPugin9h6FEIRsSHzKzUE6E4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR7TOKHLgpVVxfKAzKo8jP55tlsA93Ia_ntZ3QZPgTieA&oe=6AEDF1E0"}, {"file_name": "SS 3.png", "id": "1399872958740893", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/595123887_1399872962074226_7458714240550054071_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=z3cH6Oezh-oQ7kNvwGj9bcS&_nc_oc=Adr8VgOylDSF5KBDPQLm8njsTo3S1h5ugZtZZX-vuA8rOscJWjjedYqgw8fpRwP8c_U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ1NuGFqdm6csX7yRKGWdoRCMJDuhRPOYK9RYUfislBUQ&oe=6AEDE4CE"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover 2560x 1440x 2.png", "id": "1108114158846542", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823746_1108114162179875_4347086957557956752_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=F34dmGJF81EQ7kNvwGvoWtr&_nc_oc=AdpbD6QPHXiH-MMHOxnJ7PdLvhlT5J0spr05RQSFoNrWwWHDQfpri_F2kPsa8-ij2No&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSeML7Q4G6PXKtcjPrDuOyICG9-aGD0AoX3ZeQ2paPy4w&oe=6AEDDEEB"}, "display_name": "Titan Hell: VR Survival & Crafting", "keywords": ["survival", "crafting", "monsters", "building", "openworld"], "long_description": "The sun is setting. The forest is waking up. Grab your axe \u2014 build a shelter before nightfall, or become prey.\n\nTitan Hell: VR Survival & Crafting is an open world survival adventure set in a vast, hostile wilderness. Chop trees, forge weapons, and fight the creatures that rule the night \u2014 every decision matters.\n\nFACE THE TITAN One colossal final battle. Defeat the Titan to become the strongest survivor \u2014 and unlock the next level of danger and reward\n{2615027778909274}\n\nRIDE THE WILDERNESS Saddle up and travel on horseback. Scout new territory, outrun predators, and reach distant resources before dark.\n{2248561169318460}\n\nHUNT \u2014 OR BE HUNTED Humanoid enemies stalk the treeline. Monstrous worm beasts erupt from the earth. Track them, fight them, grow stronger.\n{1742066790171839}\n\nBUILD YOUR SAFE HOUSE Place walls, floors, and more \u2014 construct your shelter piece by piece before dark, then defend it when the forest comes for you.\n{1082425564473081}\n\nEXPLORE A HUGE OPEN WORLD Cross a massive landscape of dense forests, plains, and hidden valleys. Every region hides danger and reward.\n{1397928588959182}\n\nCRAFT, GEAR UP, SURVIVE Cut wood and forge axes, tools, and weapons with a hands-on inventory. Upgrade to face deadlier enemies.\n{1774388417318867}\n\nKEY FEATURES:\n\n1. Huge open world on foot or horseback\n2. Hands-on crafting and inventory\n3. Piece-by-piece base building\n4. Humanoid enemies and worm monsters\n5. Weapon forging and upgrades\n6. Epic Titan boss battle\n\n\n\n\n\n\n", "short_description": "Step into a  VR survival game where you hunt humanoid and worm creatures, gather wood, craft weapons, build a house, and fight to survive. Explore a hostile forest, collect resources, defend your base, and face the mighty Titan in an intense first-person action adventure packed with crafting, monster hunting, and boss battles. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://abdurrehmanmma12327.github.io/privacy-policy/titanforestsurvivalshooter/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Ascendrix Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "ht